          "charter": "Concord-chartered neutral common carrier under the 2312 Settlement. Every suspension names its principal and reason; independent sanctions survive an arrears cure.",
          "tariffs": "Published service terms are available with +relay. All mail is IC and transits. Standard pays the declared wait; Priority and Sovereign wait for capacity; Deferred waits for an off-peak window."
